   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#Fonction de green comme fraction continue\n",
    "def greenLanczosAdapt(Z, a, b):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Calcule l'image de z par la transformée de Fourier approchée \n",
    "    de la fonction de Green\"\"\"\n",
    "    frac = np.zeros_like(Z)\n",
    "    n = len(b)\n",
    "    for i in range(n-1, 0, -1):\n",
    "        frac = b[i]**2/(Z-a[i]-frac)\n",
    "    return 1/(Z-a[0]-frac)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b573d028",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Fonction spectrale"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d889cbe7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "En notant $A$ la fonction spectrale, nous avons la relation liant $A$ et $G$ la fonction de Green complexe :\n",
    "\n",
    "\\begin{align}\n",
    "A(\\omega \\pm i\\eta)=\\mp \\frac{1}{\\pi} \\Im\\left(G(\\omega \\pm i\\eta)\\right)\n",
    "\\end{align}\n",
    "\n",
    "En général, on choisit $\\eta \\sim \\frac{1}{L}$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "b8652766",
   "metadata": {
    "jupyter": {
     "source_hidden": true
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#Matrice tridiagonale\n",
    "def tridiagonale(diag,sousdiag,surdiag):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Crée une matrice tridiagionale avec les coefficients correspondants\"\"\"\n",
    "    return np.diag(diag) + np.diag(sousdiag, k =-1) + np.diag(surdiag, k =1)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "2dd25fa2",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#Fonction de green par Lanczos\n",
    "def greenLanczos(Omega, Eta, psi_c, E_0, H, m, eps):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Calcule la fonction de Green approchée par \n",
    "    l'algortihme de Lanczos\"\"\"\n",
    "    a, b = lanczos(psi_c, H, m, eps)\n",
    "    return greenLanczosAdapt((Omega + E_0 * np.ones_like(psi_c) + 1j * Eta), a, b) "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "ebbdc102-576c-4cbf-85f8-93e7144d1f9e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#Fonction spectrale par Lanczsos\n",
    "def spectraleLanczos(Omega, Eta, psi_c, H, m, eps):\n",
    "    \"\"\" Calcule la fonction spectrale approchée par l'algorithme de Lanczos\"\"\"\n",
    "    return - np.sign(Eta) * 1/np.pi * np.imag(greenLanczos(Omega, Eta, psi_c, E_0, H, m, eps))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    "
   ]
  },
